  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "scene_uOg7AWo26g",
      "stageId": "TyX6iEc3q7",
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "知识回顾：动漫历史与经典作品",
      "order": 4,
      "content": {
        "type": "quiz",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "q1",
            "type": "single",
            "question": "日本动画（anime）产业的起源通常追溯到哪一位被称为“漫画之神”的创作者？",
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "A",
                "label": "宫崎骏"
              },
              {
                "value": "B",
                "label": "手冢治虫"
              },
              {
                "value": "C",
                "label": "大友克洋"
              },
              {
                "value": "D",
                "label": "新海诚"
              }
            ],
            "answer": [
              "B"
            ],
            "analysis": "手冢治虫（Osamu Tezuka）被认为是日本现代漫画的奠基人，其《铁臂阿童木》等作品确立了战后漫画的叙事语言，也深刻影响了早期动画制作。宫崎骏是吉卜力工作室的创始人之一，大友克洋以《阿基拉》闻名，新海诚则是当代导演。",
            "points": 10,
            "hasAnswer": true
          },
          {
            "id": "q2",
            "type": "multiple",
            "question": "以下哪些作品被认为是1980-1990年代日本动画黄金时期的代表作？（多选）",
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "A",
                "label": "《阿基拉》（Akira）"
              },
              {
                "value": "B",
                "label": "《千与千寻》（Spirited Away）"
              },
              {
                "value": "C",
                "label": "《新世纪福音战士》（Neon Genesis Evangelion）"
              },
              {
                "value": "D",
                "label": "《你的名字。》（Your Name.）"
              }
            ],
            "answer": [
              "A",
              "C"
            ],
            "analysis": "《阿基拉》（1988年）是赛博朋克动画的代表作，展现了当时顶尖的作画水准；《新世纪福音战士》（1995年）引发了社会现象级的讨论，对后续作品影响深远。《千与千寻》（2001年）和《你的名字。》（2016年）属于2000年后的作品，不属于1980-90年代的黄金时期。",
            "points": 15,
            "hasAnswer": true
          },
          {
            "id": "q3",
            "type": "short_answer",
            "question": "请简要解释“萌”（moe）这一概念在当代动漫文化中的含义，并举例说明它如何影响角色设计或叙事。",
            "commentPrompt": "评分标准：(1) 正确解释“萌”的含义（情感投射、喜爱等）——40%；(2) 举例说明其对角色设计（如大眼睛、可爱外表、个性标签）或叙事（如日常互动、卖萌桥段）的影响——40%；(3) 表达清晰与逻辑性——20%。",
            "analysis": "参考要点：“萌”通常指观众对虚构角色（尤其是女性角色）产生的一种强烈喜爱或保护欲，这种情感往往源于角色的可爱外貌、性格特质（如傲娇、天然呆、温柔）或行为模式。在角色设计上，日本动漫常采用大眼睛、小鼻子、柔和线条来增强萌感；在叙事中，萌元素可以推动日常喜剧或增加情感互动，例如《轻音少女》中的角色互动即大量运用萌属性。",
            "points": 20,
            "hasAnswer": false
          }
        ],
        "knowledgePoints": [
          "手冢治虫被誉为“漫画之神”，其作品奠定了战后日本动漫的基础。",
          "1980-1990年代是日本动画的黄金时期，以《阿基拉》和《新世纪福音战士》等作品为代表。",
          "“萌”（moe）是一种源于角色可爱特质的情感投射，深刻影响了当代动漫的角色设计与叙事方式。",
          "区分不同时期的关键作品（如黄金时期与21世纪作品）有助于理解动画历史的演进。"
        ]
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_NEOk01Uc",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "好啦，同学们，我们刚刚一起探索了日本动画从起源到黄金时代的精彩旅程，还分析了《你的名字。》这样经典作品背后的叙事奥秘。现在，是时候来一场小小的知识回顾，检验一下大家的收获啦！别紧张，就像玩游戏一样，放松心态，把这次测验当作一次有趣的复习。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_d8bfysWc",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "首先来看第一题，这是一道单选题。题目问的是：日本动画产业的起源通常追溯到哪一位被称为‘漫画之神’的创作者？选项有宫崎骏、手冢治虫、大友克洋和新海诚。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_k8BS9HNJ",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "想一想我们刚才讲到的内容，谁才是那个为现代日本漫画和动画奠定基础、被誉为‘漫画之神’的人呢？答案就是B选项，手冢治虫。他创作的《铁臂阿童木》等一系列作品，确立了日本漫画的分镜和叙事方式，对后来的动画产业影响深远。而宫崎骏、大友克洋和新海诚都是后来不同时代的杰出代表。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_BHq3_YXQ",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "接下来是第二题，一道多选题。题目问的是：以下哪些作品被认为是1980-1990年代日本动画黄金时期的代表作？选项有《阿基拉》、《千与千寻》、《新世纪福音战士》和《你的名字。》。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_RX52tcyb",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "这里要特别注意时间范围哦，‘1980-1990年代’。我们来逐一核对：《阿基拉》（Akira）于1988年上映，是赛博朋克动画的里程碑，符合条件。《新世纪福音战士》（Neon Genesis Evangelion）TV版于1995年播出，也在这一时期，它对动画题材的颠覆性影响巨大。而《千与千寻》是2001年上映的，《你的名字。》是2016年，它们属于更晚的‘后吉卜力时代’和新世纪的作品。所以，这道题的正确答案是A和C。《阿基拉》（Akira）和《新世纪福音战士》（Neon Genesis Evangelion）。"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1781657529410,
      "updatedAt": 1781657529410
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_CeFq5_AjfE",
      "stageId": "TyX6iEc3q7",
      "type": "interactive",
      "title": "互动练习：分镜创作基础",
      "order": 7,
      "content": {
        "type": "interactive",
        "url": "",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>分镜叙事模拟器</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        body {\n            background: #1a1a2e;\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n            touch-action: manipulation;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 12px;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .sim-container {\n            background: #16213e;\n            border-radius: 28px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n            padding: 20px 20px 24px;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            width: 100%;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            transition: all 0.2s;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            color: #e0e0ff;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            margin: 0 0 12px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        h1 small {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n            background: #0f3460;\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            border-radius: 40px;\n        }\n        .canvas-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #0a0f1c;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            touch-action: none;\n            width: 100%;\n            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n            min-height: 200px;\n            border: 2px solid #2a3a5e;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n        canvas {\n            display: block;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: transparent;\n            pointer-events: none; /* 让拖拽事件穿透到上层，但这里用JS处理 */\n        }\n        .controls {\n            background: #1e2a45;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            padding: 16px 18px;\n            touch-action: manipulation;\n        }\n        .control-grid {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 12px 16px;\n        }\n        .control-item {\n            flex: 1 1 180px;\n            min-width: 140px;\n        }\n        .control-item label {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #c5d0eb;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n        .control-item label span.value {\n            background: #0f1a30;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n            border-radius: 40px;\n            font-family: monospace;\n            color: #bae6ff;\n        }\n        input[type=\"range\"] {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 6px;\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            appearance: none;\n            background: #2d3f66;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            outline: none;\n            touch-action: manipulation;\n        }\n        input[type=\"range\"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            appearance: none;\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            background: #7aa2f7;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid #b6d0ff;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: 0.1s;\n        }\n        input[type=\"range\"]::-moz-range-thumb {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            background: #7aa2f7;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid #b6d0ff;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n        .btn-group {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 10px;\n            margin-top: 14px;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        .btn {\n            background: #2a3f6a;\n            border: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 40px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n            min-height: 44px;\n            min-width: 80px;\n            touch-action: manipulation;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            transition: all 0.15s;\n            flex: 0 1 auto;\n        }\n        .btn:active {\n            transform: scale(0.96);\n        }\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: #4c6ef5;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: #5f7cf8;\n        }\n        .btn-success {\n            background: #2b8a3e;\n        }\n        .btn-warning {\n            background: #d97706;\n        }\n        .btn-danger {\n            background: #b91c1c;\n        }\n        .btn-outline {\n            background: transparent;\n            border: 2px solid #4c6ef5;\n            color: #b6c9ff;\n        }\n        .preset-group {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 8px;\n            margin-top: 12px;\n        }\n        .preset-btn {\n            background: #1c2a44;\n            border: 1px solid #3a5390;\n            color: #ccd9ff;\n            padding: 6px 16px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            min-height: 40px;\n            touch-action: manipulation;\n            transition: 0.1s;\n            flex: 0 1 auto;\n        }\n        .preset-btn:active {\n            background: #2a4070;\n        }\n        .state-indicator {\n            color: #aab9e6;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 12px;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            margin-left: auto;\n        }\n        .state-indicator span {\n            background: #0f1a2e;\n            padding: 2px 14px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 540px) {\n            .sim-container {\n                padding: 12px 12px 18px;\n                border-radius: 20px;\n            }\n            h1 {\n                font-size: 1.2rem;\n            }\n            .control-item {\n                flex: 1 1 100%;\n                min-width: 0;\n            }\n            .btn {\n                padding: 8px 16px;\n                font-size: 0.8rem;\n                min-height: 44px;\n                flex: 1 0 auto;\n            }\n            .preset-btn {\n                font-size: 0.7rem;\n                padding: 5px 12px;\n            }\n            .btn-group {\n                gap: 6px;\n            }\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 400px) {\n            .canvas-wrapper {\n                aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;\n                min-height: 160px;\n            }\n        }\n        .annotation-tip {\n            position: fixed;\n            background: #7c3aed;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 40px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 999;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n            animation: fadeSlide 0.25s ease-out;\n        }\n        @keyframes fadeSlide {\n            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }\n            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n        .hidden { display: none; }\n    </style>\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.css\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\n    const katexOptions = {\n        delimiters: [\n            {left: '\\\\[', right: '\\\\]', display: true},\n            {left: '\\\\(', right: '\\\\)', display: false},\n            {left: '$$', right: '$$', display: true},\n            {left: '$', right: '$', display: false}\n        ],\n        throwOnError: false,\n        strict: false,\n        trust: true\n    };\n\n    let renderTimeout;\n    function safeRender() {\n        if (renderTimeout) clearTimeout(renderTimeout);\n        renderTimeout = setTimeout(() => {\n            renderMathInElement(document.body, katexOptions);\n        }, 100);\n    }\n\n    renderMathInElement(document.body, katexOptions);\n\n    const observer = new MutationObserver((mutations) => {\n        let shouldRender = false;\n        mutations.forEach((mutation) => {\n            if (mutation.target &&\n                mutation.target.className &&\n                typeof mutation.target.className === 'string' &&\n                mutation.target.className.includes('katex')) {\n                return;\n            }\n            shouldRender = true;\n        });\n\n        if (shouldRender) {\n            safeRender();\n        }\n    });\n\n    observer.observe(document.body, {\n        childList: true,\n        subtree: true,\n        characterData: true\n    });\n\n    setInterval(() => {\n        const text = document.body.innerText;\n        if (text.includes('\\\\(') || text.includes('$$')) {\n            safeRender();\n        }\n    }, 2000);\n});\n</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"sim-container\" id=\"app\">\n        <h1>\n            🎬 分镜叙事·基础逻辑\n            <small>拖拽排序 · 切换镜头</small>\n        </h1>\n\n        <div class=\"canvas-wrapper\" id=\"canvasWrapper\">\n            <canvas id=\"storyCanvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"controls\" id=\"controlPanel\">\n            <div class=\"control-grid\">\n                <!-- 镜头类型 -->\n                <div class=\"control-item\">\n                    <label>📷 镜头类型 <span class=\"value\" id=\"lens-display\">中景</span></label>\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"lens-slider\" data-var=\"lens\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" aria-label=\"镜头类型: 0广角 1中景 2特写\">\n                </div>\n                <!-- 分格顺序 (用滑块模拟3格) -->\n                <div class=\"control-item\">\n                    <label>🔢 分格顺序 <span class=\"value\" id=\"order-display\">A→B→C</span></label>\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"order-slider\" data-var=\"order\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"分格排列顺序\">\n                </div>\n                <!-- 动作方向 -->\n                <div class=\"control-item\">\n                    <label>➡️ 动作方向 <span class=\"value\" id=\"direction-display\">→ 向右</span></label>\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"direction-slider\" data-var=\"direction\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" aria-label=\"动作方向: 0左 1右 2跳跃\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"btn-group\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"start-btn\">▶ 播放故事</button>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"reset-btn\">⟲ 重置</button>\n                <div class=\"state-indicator\">\n                    <span id=\"stateLabel\">⏸ 就绪</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"preset-group\">\n                <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"classic\">📖 经典三格</button>\n                <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"action\">💥 动作冲击</button>\n                <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-preset=\"closeup\">🔍 特写情绪</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Widget Config -->\n    <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"widget-config\">\n    {\n        \"type\": \"simulation\",\n        \"concept\": \"分镜叙事的基础逻辑\",\n        \"description\": \"通过拖拽排序和镜头调整，理解分镜如何传递故事节奏与情绪。\",\n        \"variables\": [\n            { \"name\": \"lens\", \"label\": \"镜头类型\", \"min\": 0, \"max\": 2, \"default\": 1, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"\" },\n            { \"name\": \"order\", \"label\": \"分格顺序\", \"min\": 0, \"max\": 2, \"default\": 0, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"\" },\n            { \"name\": \"direction\", \"label\": \"动作方向\", \"min\": 0, \"max\": 2, \"default\": 1, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"\" }\n        ],\n        \"presets\": [\n            { \"name\": \"经典三格\", \"variables\": { \"lens\": 1, \"order\": 0, \"direction\": 1 } },\n            { \"name\": \"动作冲击\", \"variables\": { \"lens\": 0, \"order\": 1, \"direction\": 2 } },\n            { \"name\": \"特写情绪\", \"variables\": { \"lens\": 2, \"order\": 0, \"direction\": 0 } }\n        ]\n    }\n    </script>\n\n    <script>\n        (function() {\n            // ---- DOM refs ----\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('storyCanvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            const wrapper = document.getElementById('canvasWrapper');\n\n            const lensSlider = document.getElementById('lens-slider');\n            const orderSlider = document.getElementById('order-slider');\n            const directionSlider = document.getElementById('direction-slider');\n            const lensDisplay = document.getElementById('lens-display');\n            const orderDisplay = document.getElementById('order-display');\n            const directionDisplay = document.getElementById('direction-display');\n            const startBtn = document.getElementById('start-btn');\n            const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset-btn');\n            const stateLabel = document.getElementById('stateLabel');\n\n            // ---- state ----\n            let lens = 1;          // 0广角,1中景,2特写\n            let order = 0;         // 0:ABC, 1:BCA, 2:CAB\n            let direction = 1;     // 0左,1右,2跳跃\n\n            let playing = false;\n            let animFrame = null;\n            let time = 0;          // 动画时间 (0~100)\n            const DURATION = 100;  // 帧数\n\n            // ---- 镜头标签 ----\n            const lensLabels = ['广角', '中景', '特写'];\n            const orderLabels = ['A→B→C', 'B→C→A', 'C→A→B'];\n            const directionLabels = ['← 向左', '→ 向右', '⬆ 跳跃'];\n\n            // ---- 更新显示 ----\n            function updateUI() {\n                lensDisplay.textContent = lensLabels[lens] || '中景';\n                orderDisplay.textContent = orderLabels[order] || 'A→B→C';\n                directionDisplay.textContent = directionLabels[direction] || '→ 向右';\n            }\n\n            // ---- 从滑块读取 ----\n            function readSliders() {\n                lens = parseInt(lensSlider.value, 10);\n                order = parseInt(orderSlider.value, 10);\n                direction = parseInt(directionSlider.value, 10);\n                updateUI();\n            }\n\n            function applySliders() {\n                lensSlider.value = lens;\n                orderSlider.value = order;\n                directionSlider.value = direction;\n                updateUI();\n            }\n\n            // ---- 重置模拟 ----\n            function resetSimulation(resetSlider = true) {\n                if (animFrame) {\n                    cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame);\n                    animFrame = null;\n                }\n                playing = false;\n                time = 0;\n                startBtn.textContent = '▶ 播放故事';\n                stateLabel.textContent = '⏸ 就绪';\n                if (resetSlider) {\n                    lens = 1;\n                    order = 0;\n                    direction = 1;\n                    applySliders();\n                }\n                drawCanvas();\n            }\n\n            // ---- Canvas 绘图 ----\n            function drawCanvas() {\n                const rect = wrapper.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const w = rect.width || 800;\n                const h = rect.height || 450;\n                canvas.width = w * 0.99; \n                canvas.height = h * 0.99;\n\n                const cw = canvas.width;\n                const ch = canvas.height;\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, cw, ch);\n\n                // 背景\n                const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, cw, ch);\n                grad.addColorStop(0, '#192231');\n                grad.addColorStop(1, '#2c3a5a');\n                ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, cw, ch);\n\n                // ---- 分镜格子参数 ----\n                const padX = 20;\n                const padY = 25;\n                const gap = 14;\n                const totalG = 3;\n                const usableW = cw - padX * 2 - gap * (totalG - 1);\n                const cellW = usableW / totalG;\n                const cellH = ch - padY * 2;\n\n                // 顺序偏移索引  (0,1,2) -> 根据order重排\n                const orderMap = [\n                    [0, 1, 2],  // ABC\n                    [1, 2, 0],  // BCA\n                    [2, 0, 1]   // CAB\n                ];\n                const seq = orderMap[order] || [0,1,2];\n\n                // 每个格子的内容标签\n                const sceneLabels = ['开场', '冲突', '收尾'];\n\n                // ---- 画三个格子 ----\n                for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                    const idx = seq[i]; // 实际显示的内容索引\n                    const x = padX + i * (cellW + gap);\n                    const y = padY;\n                    const wc = cellW;\n                    const hc = cellH;\n\n                    // 格子背景\n                    ctx.fillStyle = '#1f2c44';\n                    ctx.shadowColor = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.5)';\n                    ctx.shadowBlur = 12;\n                    ctx.fillRect(x, y, wc, hc);\n                    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = '#4c6f9c';\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n                    ctx.strokeRect(x, y, wc, hc);\n\n                    // 标签\n                    ctx.fillStyle = '#b8cbe0';\n                    ctx.font = 'bold 18px \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif';\n                    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n                    ctx.textBaseline = 'top';\n                    ctx.fillText(sceneLabels[idx] || '格', x + wc/2, y + 8);\n\n                    // ---- 根据镜头类型绘制内容 (lens) ----\n                    const cx = x + wc/2;\n                    const cy = y + hc/2 + 12;\n\n                    // 人物 (简单火柴人/形状)\n                    const headR = (lens === 2) ? 18 : (lens === 0 ? 10 : 14);\n                    const bodyH = (lens === 2) ? 20 : (lens === 0 ? 32 : 28);\n\n                    // 动作偏移 (由direction和时间决定)\n                    let moveX = 0, moveY = 0;\n                    if (direction === 0) moveX = - (time / DURATION) * 20;\n                    else if (direction === 1) moveX = (time / DURATION) * 20;\n                    else if (direction === 2) {\n                        moveY = -Math.abs(Math.sin((time / DURATION) * Math.PI)) * 30;\n                    }\n\n                    // 颜色根据镜头\n                    const hue = (lens === 0) ? 200 : (lens === 2 ? 330 : 260);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `hsl(${hue}, 60%, 70%)`;\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = '#fff';\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n\n                    // 头\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(cx + moveX, cy - 10 + moveY, headR, 0, Math.PI*2);\n                    ctx.fill();\n                    ctx.stroke();\n\n                    // 身体 (线条或矩形)\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(cx + moveX, cy - 10 + headR + moveY);\n                    ctx.lineTo(cx + moveX, cy + bodyH + moveY);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n\n                    // 手臂 (动态)\n                    const armAngle = (time / DURATION) * Math.PI * 0.6;\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(cx + moveX, cy + 6 + moveY);\n                    ctx.lineTo(cx + moveX + 16 * Math.cos(armAngle + 0.3) * (direction === 1?1:-1), cy + 6 + moveY + 12 * Math.sin(armAngle));\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(cx + moveX, cy + 6 + moveY);\n                    ctx.lineTo(cx + moveX + 16 * Math.cos(-armAngle + 0.3) * (direction === 1?1:-1), cy + 6 + moveY + 12 * Math.sin(-armAngle));\n                    ctx.stroke();\n\n                    // 腿\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(cx + moveX, cy + bodyH + moveY);\n                    ctx.lineTo(cx + moveX - 8 + moveX*0.2, cy + bodyH + 20 + moveY);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(cx + moveX, cy + bodyH + moveY);\n                    ctx.lineTo(cx + moveX + 8 + moveX*0.2, cy + bodyH + 20 + moveY);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n\n                    // 广角加背景细节\n                    if (lens === 0 && i === 1) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#4f7a5a';\n                        ctx.font = '14px sans-serif';\n                        ctx.fillText('🏔️ 远山', x+6, y+ hc-20);\n                    }\n                    if (lens === 2 && i === 0) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#d9b68a';\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.arc(cx-10+moveX, cy-16+moveY, 3, 0, Math.PI*2);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#c9886a';\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.arc(cx+10+moveX, cy-16+moveY, 3, 0, Math.PI*2);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    }\n\n                    // 动作方向指示 (小箭头)\n                    if (direction === 0) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#f5c542';\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(cx-25+moveX, cy+moveY-4);\n                        ctx.lineTo(cx-35+moveX, cy+moveY);\n                        ctx.lineTo(cx-25+moveX, cy+moveY+4);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    } else if (direction === 1) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#f5c542';\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(cx+25+moveX, cy+moveY-4);\n                        ctx.lineTo(cx+35+moveX, cy+moveY);\n                        ctx.lineTo(cx+25+moveX, cy+moveY+4);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    } else if (direction === 2) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#f5c542';\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(cx+moveX-4, cy-30+moveY);\n                        ctx.lineTo(cx+moveX, cy-40+moveY);\n                        ctx.lineTo(cx+moveX+4, cy-30+moveY);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // 标题水印\n                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(200,220,255,0.2)';\n                ctx.font = '14px sans-serif';\n                ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n                ctx.fillText('🎬 分镜叙事', 12, ch-12);\n            }\n\n            // ---- 动画循环 ----\n            function animate() {\n                if (!playing) return;\n\n                time += 1.4; // 速度\n                if (time >= DURATION) {\n                    time = DURATION;\n                    playing = false;\n                    startBtn.textContent = '▶ 重播';\n                    stateLabel.textContent = '✓ 播放完成';\n                    drawCanvas();\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                drawCanvas();\n                animFrame = requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            function startPlay() {\n                if (playing) {\n                    // 如果正在播放，暂停\n                    playing = false;\n                    startBtn.textContent = '▶ 继续';\n                    stateLabel.textContent = '⏸ 暂停';\n                    if (animFrame) cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame);\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                // 如果已经结束或暂停，重新开始或继续\n                if (time >= DURATION) {\n                    time = 0;\n                }\n                playing = true;\n                startBtn.textContent = '⏸ 暂停';\n                stateLabel.textContent = '▶ 播放中';\n                if (animFrame) cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame);\n                animate();\n            }\n\n            // ---- 重置 ----\n            function handleReset() {\n                readSliders();\n                resetSimulation(false);\n                applySliders();\n                drawCanvas();\n            }\n\n            // ---- 预设 ----\n            function applyPreset(name) {\n                let v;\n                if (name === 'classic') v = { lens:1, order:0, direction:1 };\n                else if (name === 'action') v = { lens:0, order:1, direction:2 };\n                else if (name === 'closeup') v = { lens:2, order:0, direction:0 };\n                if (!v) return;\n                lens = v.lens; order = v.order; direction = v.direction;\n                applySliders();\n                resetSimulation(false);\n                drawCanvas();\n            }\n\n            // ---- 初始化 & 事件绑定 ----\n            function init() {\n                readSliders();\n                drawCanvas();\n\n                // 滑块事件\n                lensSlider.addEventListener('input', function(e) {\n                    if (playing) { playing = false; if(animFrame)cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame); startBtn.textContent='▶ 播放故事'; stateLabel.textContent='⏸ 就绪'; }\n                    readSliders();\n                    time = 0;\n                    drawCanvas();\n                });\n                orderSlider.addEventListener('input', function(e) {\n                    if (playing) { playing = false; if(animFrame)cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame); startBtn.textContent='▶ 播放故事'; stateLabel.textContent='⏸ 就绪'; }\n                    readSliders();\n                    time = 0;\n                    drawCanvas();\n                });\n                directionSlider.addEventListener('input', function(e) {\n                    if (playing) { playing = false; if(animFrame)cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame); startBtn.textContent='▶ 播放故事'; stateLabel.textContent='⏸ 就绪'; }\n                    readSliders();\n                    time = 0;\n                    drawCanvas();\n                });\n\n                startBtn.addEventListener('click', startPlay);\n                resetBtn.addEventListener('click', handleReset);\n\n                // 预设\n                document.querySelectorAll('.preset-btn').forEach(btn => {\n                    btn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n                        const preset = this.dataset.preset;\n                        applyPreset(preset);\n                    });\n                });\n\n                // 窗口resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', function() {\n                    drawCanvas();\n                });\n                new ResizeObserver(() => drawCanvas()).observe(wrapper);\n\n                // 键盘快捷键\n                document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {\n                    if (e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'Space') {\n                        e.preventDefault();\n                        startPlay();\n                    }\n                    if (e.key === 'r' || e.key === 'R') {\n                        e.preventDefault();\n                        handleReset();\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            // ---- postMessage listener (teacher actions) ----\n            window.addEventListener('message', function(event) {\n                const { type, target, state, content } = event.data;\n\n                switch (type) {\n                    case 'SET_WIDGET_STATE': {\n                        if (state) {\n                            Object.entries(state).forEach(([key, value]) => {\n                                const slider = document.getElementById(key + '-slider') || document.querySelector('[data-var=\"' + key + '\"]');\n                                if (slider) {\n                                    slider.value = value;\n                                    slider.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));\n                                }\n                            });\n                        }\n                        break;\n                    }\n                    case 'HIGHLIGHT_ELEMENT': {\n                        const highlightEl = document.querySelector(target);\n                        if (highlightEl) {\n                            highlightEl.style.outline = '3px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.8)';\n                            highlightEl.style.outlineOffset = '4px';\n                            highlightEl.style.animation = 'pulse-highlight 2s infinite';\n                            setTimeout(() => {\n                                highlightEl.style.outline = '';\n                                highlightEl.style.animation = '';\n                            }, 3000);\n                        }\n                        break;\n                    }\n                    case 'ANNOTATE_ELEMENT': {\n                        const annotateEl = document.querySelector(target);\n                        if (annotateEl && content) {\n                            const rect = annotateEl.getBoundingClientRect();\n                            const tooltip = document.createElement('div');\n                            tooltip.className = 'annotation-tip';\n                            tooltip.style.cssText = 'position:fixed; top:' + (rect.top - 40) + 'px; left:' + rect.left + 'px; background:rgba(139,92,246,0.95); color:white; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:40px; font-size:14px; z-index:1000;';\n                            tooltip.textContent = content;\n                            document.body.appendChild(tooltip);\n                            setTimeout(() => tooltip.remove(), 4000);\n                        }\n                        break;\n                    }\n                    case 'REVEAL_ELEMENT': {\n                        const revealEl = document.querySelector(target);\n                        if (revealEl) {\n                            revealEl.style.display = '';\n                            revealEl.style.opacity = '1';\n                        }\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n\n            // ---- 注入关键帧动画 ----\n            const styleSheet = document.createElement('style');\n            styleSheet.textContent = `\n                @keyframes pulse-highlight {\n                    0%, 100% { outline-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.8); }\n                    50% { outline-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); }\n                }\n            `;\n            document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\n\n            // 启动\n            init();\n        })();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "widgetType": "simulation",
